%% An employee sync with conflict resolution (area 1, built). A sync is always previewed first,
%% and an apply writes exactly what HR saw.
sequenceDiagram
  actor HR as HR, Singapore
  participant Web as Web app
  participant API as API: SyncService
  participant Job as BullMQ: SyncPipeline
  participant SG as SG HR (mock)
  participant M as Employee master

  HR->>Web: Run sync: preview
  Web->>API: POST /connectors/sg-hr/sync (PREVIEW, Idempotency-Key)
  API->>Job: queue the run (job id = run id), audited
  Job->>SG: GET employees, page by page
  SG-->>Job: records in its own field names
  Job->>Job: map with the active mapping version, then validate
  Job-->>Web: sync.progress on the live stream (ids and counts, never values)
  Job->>M: plan the creates, updates and conflicts, writing nothing
  Job-->>API: preview done: the changes and their fingerprint
  API-->>Web: what would change, with possible matches for HR
  HR->>Web: Apply
  Web->>API: POST /connectors/sg-hr/sync (APPLY, the preview's id)
  API->>API: a successful preview of this connector, under 30 minutes old?
  API->>Job: queue the apply
  Job->>Job: plan again: does the fingerprint still match?
  alt the source changed since the preview
    Job-->>API: SOURCE_CHANGED: nothing written, preview again
  else unchanged
    Job->>M: merge each field by its source of truth
    M->>M: sources disagree on an unowned field: open a conflict
    Job-->>Web: sync.run.completed
  end
  HR->>Web: open the conflict, choose a source
  Web->>API: POST /conflicts/:id/resolve (SOURCE_SELECTED)
  API->>M: the value, its history line and the audit event, in one transaction
